# Density Compare
# Curium (Cm) — real density 13.51 g/cm³. equal masses: Curium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Curium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 8.4mm color: #80ffa0 at (-20mm, 4.2mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 107.8 g — the water cube is the reference
